SCENE Scene1

IMPORT Player.ntt Player 300 200
IMPORT NPC1.ntt Player -200 200
IMPORT Light.ntt Player 000 200
IMPORT Road.ntt Player 000 000

ENTITY AmbientLight
COMPONENT Transform 0 0 0 0 0
COMPONENT Ambient 0.2 0.2 0.2 1.0

ENTITY Camera
COMPONENT Camera Player
COMPONENT Script CameraScript
ENTITYINIT Camera

ENTITY Hand
COMPONENT Script HandScript
ENTITYINIT Hand